// S3: two RESOURCES may not cover overlapping bytes — the
// mirror of ward's W1, naming both objects and both ranges.
//
// Deliberately the HARD pairing: the collision is between Sprite0's SECOND range
// and Other's FIRST. A check that compared only the first range of each resource
// would pass this file, so the fixture pins all-pairs walking, not just overlap.
sigil Sprite0 { 0xDFF120 .. 0xDFF124, 0xDFF140 .. 0xDFF148 }
sigil Other   { 0xDFF144 .. 0xDFF150 }

fn main() { }
